    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "1EEACFED15ABF95A",
      "text": "¡Bienvenid[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa al Gimnasio de Pueblo Pirotín!\\c\\n¿Quieres que te vuelva a explicar el examen de\\neste gimnasio?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "1EEACEED15ABF7A7",
      "text": "Pues el examen del Gimnasio de Pueblo Pirotín\\nes... ¡la [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]aceitunada[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "1EEACDED15ABF5F4",
      "text": "Para aprobar el examen, deberás hacer rodar\\nhasta la meta un balón con forma de aceituna.\\c\\n¡Si lo consigues, seguro que tendremos una\\ncosecha estupenda el año que viene!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "1EEACCED15ABF441",
      "text": "El lugar de celebración de la aceitunada se halla\\nen la parte [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]norte del pueblo[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].\\c\\nDirígete allí y habla con mi compañera para que\\nte explique las reglas con más detalle.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_01",
      "hash64": "5BE83F2D0544DB8E",
      "text": "¡Bienvenid[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa al circuito de la aceitunada!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_02",
      "hash64": "5BE83E2D0544D9DB",
      "text": "Este examen de gimnasio pone a prueba tu\\nfísico para hacerte empujar un balón gigante\\r\\ncon forma de aceituna.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_03",
      "hash64": "5BE83D2D0544D828",
      "text": "¡Supera todos los obstáculos y lleva la aceituna\\ngigante hasta la meta para aprobar el examen!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_04",
      "hash64": "5BE8442D0544E40D",
      "text": "¿Qué me dices? ¿Estás preparad[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa para el reto?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_05",
      "hash64": "5BE8432D0544E25A",
      "text": "¡Muy bien! ¡Recuerda pedir una buena cosecha\\nmientras haces rodar la aceituna!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_06",
      "hash64": "5BE8422D0544E0A7",
      "text": "Vale, ¡no pasa nada! Vuelve cuando estés list[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_07",
      "hash64": "5BE8412D0544DEF4",
      "text": "¡Bienvenid[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa de nuevo! ¿Quieres probar suerte\\ncon la aceitunada?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_08",
      "hash64": "5BE8382D0544CFA9",
      "text": "Si ganas, te dejo pasar por este atajo. Si pierdes,\\nserá señal de que te has llevado una... aceitunda.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_09",
      "hash64": "5BE8372D0544CDF6",
      "text": "¿Crees que podrás superar mi barrera de Smoliv?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_10",
      "hash64": "5BE4BA2D0541C3B8",
      "text": "Venga, dejadl[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa pasar, Smoliv de mis amores...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_11",
      "hash64": "5BE4BB2D0541C56B",
      "text": "Prueba a empujarla subid[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa en una Pokémontura\\ny te digo yo que te saldrá todo rodado.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_12",
      "hash64": "5BE4BC2D0541C71E",
      "text": "¡Seguro que gracias a ti vamos a tener otro año\\nde cosechas estupendas!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_13",
      "hash64": "5BE4BD2D0541C8D1",
      "text": "¡Has aprobado el examen de gimnasio!\\n¡Enhorabuena!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_14",
      "hash64": "5BE4BE2D0541CA84",
      "text": "Ve a informar a recepción del resultado del\\nexamen, si eres tan amable.\\c\\n¡Y ánimo en el combate contra la líder!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_15",
      "hash64": "5BE4BF2D0541CC37",
      "text": "¿Quieres abandonar?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_16",
      "hash64": "5BE4C02D0541CDEA",
      "text": "¿Estás segur[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
